WEBVTT

00:08.610 --> 00:10.320
Now you understand?

00:10.320 --> 00:12.820
I'm on a completely different level.

00:13.580 --> 00:15.910
She really <i>is </i>strong.

00:15.910 --> 00:16.790
Yeah.

00:27.920 --> 00:30.930
Subaru! She's so good!

00:42.100 --> 00:45.820
I've had enough! I hate this! I hate this! I hate this!

00:46.150 --> 00:49.240
Wow, Hii! That was awesome!

00:49.240 --> 00:51.240
Yep! This may work!

00:51.240 --> 00:52.660
Tsubaki-chan! Hiiragi-chan!

00:54.530 --> 00:58.830
This is something only the two of you can do, together.

00:59.330 --> 01:03.080
Something that only we can do?

01:10.470 --> 01:11.630
Okay...

01:11.630 --> 01:12.970
Let's go, everyone!

01:13.220 --> 01:14.760
Yeah!

01:19.390 --> 01:22.470
Make them see that halation!

01:22.470 --> 01:25.890
We'll carry out the oath we made that day.

01:25.890 --> 01:28.980
Spread out, new formation!

01:28.980 --> 01:32.440
We can see the signs as we call out for one another.

01:32.440 --> 01:38.740
Place your hopes in it, shoot, and watch the arch!

01:39.030 --> 01:43.660
I believe in you, do it like you always do.

01:43.660 --> 01:45.330
Leave it to me.

01:45.330 --> 01:51.880
Put your hands on your chest, and calm yourself down.

01:51.880 --> 01:58.180
I remember each and every granted wish,

01:58.180 --> 02:04.060
including that day I cried in secret.

02:04.060 --> 02:07.560
We're not the only ones

02:07.560 --> 02:11.110
seeing these same dreams.

02:11.110 --> 02:14.730
The sparks in those unyielding eyes

02:14.730 --> 02:17.860
that appeared in front of me,

02:17.860 --> 02:19.450
let them fly!

02:19.740 --> 02:22.870
Make them see that halation!

02:22.870 --> 02:26.200
Run into that open space!

02:26.200 --> 02:32.840
This lingering sensation, looking back on those carefree days.

02:32.840 --> 02:39.380
After saying farewell, you smile with everyone else,

02:39.380 --> 02:45.680
aim for the place you dreamed of, shoot, and watch the arch!

02:48.390 --> 02:50.270
Aw man.

02:50.270 --> 02:52.310
Stop passing the ball around.

02:52.310 --> 02:54.310
Just give it to me already.

02:54.310 --> 02:57.190
You can't win without me, after all.

03:00.370 --> 03:01.750
Thank ye!

03:01.750 --> 03:04.380
Well then, here I go!

03:07.710 --> 03:09.670
I'm in top condition today!

03:09.670 --> 03:12.390
No one can stop me!

03:13.430 --> 03:14.760
I'll stop you!

03:15.470 --> 03:16.680
Useless!

03:17.390 --> 03:18.640
It's not over yet!

03:18.640 --> 03:20.730
Another one?!

03:20.730 --> 03:22.020
But it's still useless!

03:24.610 --> 03:25.610
We're not done yet!

03:26.150 --> 03:27.280
You've got to be kidding me!

03:32.070 --> 03:34.410
Suzuridani #13! Offensive foul!

03:35.410 --> 03:37.660
How'd you like our twin hell?

03:37.660 --> 03:40.330
We aren't afraid of you anymore!

03:40.870 --> 03:43.330
Stop it already, seriously...

03:43.710 --> 03:47.210
Yes! Nice job, Tsuba-Hii!

03:48.590 --> 03:51.010
She's a beginner at basketball?

03:51.010 --> 03:55.430
Rena-san is only good at one-on-one plays.

03:55.430 --> 03:58.310
But this is a mini-basketball game.

03:58.310 --> 04:01.520
She can't do whatever she wants in a 5v5 game.

04:01.850 --> 04:04.730
It's really easy to break through our plan,

04:04.730 --> 04:07.270
but only if you know how to play basketball properly.

04:07.270 --> 04:08.150
However...

04:08.610 --> 04:10.150
Hey! Out of my way!

04:10.150 --> 04:11.680
Rena! Over here!

04:11.680 --> 04:12.610
Pass it to me now!

04:12.950 --> 04:13.820
Shut up!

04:17.330 --> 04:18.910
Suzuridani #13!

04:21.040 --> 04:25.290
She's very confident in her one-on-one abilities, so she'll never pass.

04:25.290 --> 04:26.380
I see.

04:26.380 --> 04:28.960
She's the only one without the right mindset.

04:29.300 --> 04:34.130
One of their five isn't a proper basketball player.

04:34.130 --> 04:37.350
There's no way I won't exploit that weakness.

04:38.850 --> 04:40.350
Mark them tightly!

04:40.600 --> 04:44.190
Come on now, everybody stop them.

04:46.270 --> 04:47.690
Please, Masami!

04:49.650 --> 04:51.900
Prepare to regret, Ashihara Rena.

04:51.900 --> 04:54.360
Regret your own irresponsible way of life.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.450
Huh?

05:02.700 --> 05:04.540
Nice shot, Masami!

05:04.540 --> 05:05.790
Wonderful!

05:06.250 --> 05:07.380
Thanks!

05:07.380 --> 05:09.790
But the one behind all this is...

05:12.590 --> 05:14.300
Rena, what are you doing?!

05:14.300 --> 05:15.800
You left her wide open!

05:15.800 --> 05:17.300
Mark her properly!

05:18.050 --> 05:22.680
Jeez, this isn't fun at all now.

05:30.190 --> 05:34.740
Man, basketball is such a crappy game.

05:34.740 --> 05:37.530
I never lose by myself.

05:37.530 --> 05:39.870
But having five players just kills my momentum.

05:39.870 --> 05:42.040
This isn't fun at all.

05:46.080 --> 05:49.920
This sucks. I should just go home.

05:50.590 --> 05:51.540
You coward.

05:53.550 --> 05:56.550
Aya, who are you talking to?

05:56.930 --> 05:59.050
You, Rena.

05:59.050 --> 06:03.180
You're not taking responsibility for your weaknesses.

06:03.180 --> 06:04.560
You're a real coward.

06:04.890 --> 06:08.690
Oh? Someone's gotten quite cocky.

06:08.690 --> 06:11.060
You haven't even been on the team for very long.

06:11.360 --> 06:15.190
That's right. I did just join.

06:15.190 --> 06:18.320
But you haven't been playing basketball at all!

06:18.320 --> 06:20.700
Huh? I've been playing basketball all game!

06:20.700 --> 06:21.740
No, you haven't!

06:21.740 --> 06:24.080
You're selfish and you waste our possessions!

06:24.080 --> 06:26.700
You even let the other team shoot wide open shots!

06:26.700 --> 06:28.330
That's not basketball at all!

06:28.670 --> 06:30.790
That's because of the rules!

06:30.790 --> 06:32.090
It's not my fault!

06:32.420 --> 06:34.590
All of you! Stop delaying the game!

06:34.840 --> 06:36.920
Any longer and it's a foul!

06:37.170 --> 06:40.590
Wake up! We can win!

06:40.590 --> 06:42.930
If you play basketball seriously...

06:43.600 --> 06:45.810
Do you want to help us win?

06:45.810 --> 06:47.930
Or do you want to make us lose?

06:48.180 --> 06:49.810
It's your choice!

06:52.900 --> 06:54.320
That's...

07:00.910 --> 07:02.740
That's enough! That's quite enough!

07:02.740 --> 07:04.830
Suzuridani! #12 and #13!

07:16.920 --> 07:20.130
Looks like I've got no choice but to be your opponent!

07:20.130 --> 07:23.430
I don't want to be the reason that we lose!

07:23.720 --> 07:26.430
Sure! If you can stop me!

07:27.470 --> 07:28.310
One!

07:28.310 --> 07:29.770
You're not getting past me!

07:30.480 --> 07:31.270
Two!

07:31.730 --> 07:32.770
I'm not done yet!

07:33.520 --> 07:34.190
And three!

07:34.690 --> 07:36.190
Even more?!

07:40.360 --> 07:41.530
Mimi! You're awesome!

07:41.530 --> 07:42.490
What was that just now?

07:42.490 --> 07:43.240
You did it!

07:43.570 --> 07:47.990
That felt... quite nice.

07:50.620 --> 07:52.500
I'll stop you again!

07:57.090 --> 07:58.630
Th-That move!

07:58.630 --> 08:00.800
She only saw it once!

08:00.800 --> 08:03.720
Wow, her talent is really something.

08:04.550 --> 08:05.970
Too easy!

08:07.180 --> 08:08.220
Not over yet!

08:12.480 --> 08:14.600
I won't fall for the same thing twice!

08:29.450 --> 08:31.750
Even if you blow by us one-on-one,

08:31.750 --> 08:34.040
we won't lose as a team!

08:34.040 --> 08:35.500
Yeah!

08:38.750 --> 08:41.840
<i>I can't win... by myself?</i>

08:47.140 --> 08:47.640
Rena!

08:48.970 --> 08:50.430
Got it!

08:53.980 --> 08:55.350
Rena! Let's go!

08:58.820 --> 09:00.940
Rena! Make a run for it and jump!

09:04.150 --> 09:05.780
Please make it!

09:05.780 --> 09:06.990
No way!

09:07.280 --> 09:10.950
If I fail here, that'd be the
embarrassment of the century!

09:21.670 --> 09:23.120
No way!

09:23.120 --> 09:25.130
What?! An alley-oop?!

09:25.130 --> 09:28.130
I didn't expect to see that in a mini-basketball game.

09:28.430 --> 09:30.140
Nice shot, Rena.

09:33.890 --> 09:35.890
Keishin

09:33.890 --> 09:35.890
Academy

09:33.890 --> 09:35.890
Suzuridani

09:33.890 --> 09:35.890
Girls School

09:35.890 --> 09:39.270
Good job, everyone. That was great.

09:39.270 --> 09:42.570
The sixth-years will start the third quarter.

09:42.570 --> 09:45.900
But we may substitute players if the situation arises.

09:45.900 --> 09:48.610
Don't give up until the very end, fifth-years!

09:48.610 --> 09:49.780
Okay!

09:50.450 --> 09:52.990
I don't think it'll end like this.

09:53.830 --> 09:55.290
Yeah.

09:55.750 --> 09:57.210
Please!

09:57.210 --> 10:00.170
Let me play in the third quarter.

10:00.170 --> 10:02.050
I feel like I understand it now.

10:02.250 --> 10:07.180
Basketball with five players might actually be fun.

10:07.180 --> 10:08.800
So please...

10:11.260 --> 10:12.720
Sure.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.770
We don't have a problem with that.

10:16.770 --> 10:19.190
The sixth-years all agree.

10:19.190 --> 10:20.400
Yep.

10:21.400 --> 10:25.690
We need the strength of our entire team in order to defeat Keishin.

10:26.240 --> 10:31.700
We'll teach you how we play. What <i>real</i> basketball is.

10:33.740 --> 10:36.040
Then to start the third quarter...

10:36.040 --> 10:40.170
Miyu, Rena, Kumi, Ran, and...

10:41.080 --> 10:41.700
Aya.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.500
Eh?

10:42.500 --> 10:47.470
Our hope against Airi-chan in the third quarter will be you, Aya.

10:47.800 --> 10:49.010
Do your best.

10:49.550 --> 10:52.930
I-I will go up against Airi-san...

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Bust size

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
None, and we don't care either.

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Rival

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Misawa Maho

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Name

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Takenaka Tsubaki / Hiiragi

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Date of birth

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Blood type

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Class

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
5th Year, Class A

10:56.100 --> 10:58.980
Height

11:10.110 --> 11:10.950
Miyu-senpai!

11:20.420 --> 11:23.040
Both of them are guarding Airi!

11:23.040 --> 11:24.340
That means it's up to me now...

11:24.590 --> 11:26.340
So you're the ace?

11:27.300 --> 11:29.340
I won't let you pass, no matter what!

11:36.390 --> 11:37.520
S-So fast!

11:43.940 --> 11:45.820
I'll guard her.

11:45.820 --> 11:47.320
But!

11:47.320 --> 11:50.990
You need to stop #5 first.

11:50.990 --> 11:52.450
Then we'll talk.

11:56.030 --> 11:59.450
Go!

12:01.460 --> 12:03.460
Oh? You're guarding me?

12:05.080 --> 12:07.460
Why do <i>I</i> have to do this?

12:12.930 --> 12:14.590
Hell yeah!

12:16.550 --> 12:17.850
I won't let you pass!

12:17.850 --> 12:19.810
Then I'll go this way!

12:21.060 --> 12:22.480
Just kidding!

12:22.480 --> 12:23.230
This way!

12:24.350 --> 12:27.360
Go!

12:28.650 --> 12:30.740
Oh yeah!

12:30.740 --> 12:33.570
Oh! Maho's in top condition!

12:33.570 --> 12:35.400
Yay!

12:33.570 --> 12:35.400
Oh!

12:37.660 --> 12:40.660
Okay! I'll score again!

12:41.160 --> 12:43.660
<i>I hate this! She really pisses me off!</i>

12:44.290 --> 12:46.670
Take this!

12:47.000 --> 12:48.920
You...

12:55.680 --> 12:57.330
Suzuridani #13!

12:57.800 --> 12:59.510
My foot...

12:59.510 --> 13:00.770
Maho!

13:00.770 --> 13:02.340
Maho-chan!

13:08.020 --> 13:09.820
It looks like she twisted her ankle.

13:10.230 --> 13:11.940
You'll need to rest for a while.

13:11.940 --> 13:13.820
You can't go back immediately.

13:15.360 --> 13:18.200
I'm fine! This is nothing!

13:18.200 --> 13:19.660
No, Maho!

13:19.660 --> 13:21.410
Kagetsu-chan will sub in for you.

13:21.410 --> 13:23.160
Subaru!

13:25.750 --> 13:27.790
Just take a good rest now.

13:27.790 --> 13:29.880
Hatano-sensei, please take care of her.

13:29.880 --> 13:31.210
All right.

13:47.770 --> 13:48.900
Not in my house!

13:51.770 --> 13:52.900
Nice, Kage!

14:01.580 --> 14:03.950
She's concerned about her last foul.

14:03.950 --> 14:06.460
One more and she's out of the game.

14:07.290 --> 14:09.330
Even if she hadn't picked up that last foul,

14:09.330 --> 14:12.460
she wouldn't have been able to guard her.

14:12.460 --> 14:14.010
Focus, everyone!

14:14.010 --> 14:15.720
We have to keep on scoring!

14:15.720 --> 14:16.970
Okay!

14:19.050 --> 14:20.760
Mokkan...

14:26.980 --> 14:28.440
Saki! Over here!

14:28.440 --> 14:29.810
Tomo!

14:36.900 --> 14:39.440
Nice! That's my Mokkan!

14:40.320 --> 14:42.780
We have to play even harder, for Maho's sake!

14:42.780 --> 14:43.780
Yeah!

14:48.160 --> 14:51.830
We won't lose! Not after practicing so much!

14:52.540 --> 14:54.340
All to defeat you!

14:56.460 --> 14:58.420
I won't lose!

15:02.090 --> 15:03.170
How's that?!

15:03.430 --> 15:07.560
What persistence! She had no shot from there...

15:08.180 --> 15:13.560
We've also practiced very hard! Just to beat you, too!

15:16.610 --> 15:17.820
This time, I win!

15:18.190 --> 15:19.320
I'm not gonna lose!

15:20.570 --> 15:22.070
It's over!

15:22.070 --> 15:24.530
You can't stop me like that!

15:24.530 --> 15:27.160
This is the precious shot from me and Subaru-san!

15:27.160 --> 15:30.080
Go! Tomoka!

15:39.170 --> 15:40.840
A floater?!

15:40.840 --> 15:40.880
A floater?!

15:55.690 --> 15:59.570
Wow! They're both so good!
Are they really elementary schoolers?

15:59.570 --> 16:03.030
Our ace may be better, but we're still in trouble.

16:03.030 --> 16:06.410
Keishin's been pressured just by losing Maho.

16:12.210 --> 16:13.580
Gettan! She's coming!

16:21.720 --> 16:24.840
I-I'm sorry! I'm no use at all!

16:24.840 --> 16:28.310
That's not true, Kagetsu-chan. You've played well.

16:28.640 --> 16:31.600
Hey, I'm fine now.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.220
Don't force yourself.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.900
I'm not!

16:34.900 --> 16:36.650
It doesn't hurt at all now!

16:36.650 --> 16:39.070
So can I play? Please?

16:40.070 --> 16:41.560
Maho...

16:41.860 --> 16:43.990
Is that how much you trust us?

16:45.530 --> 16:48.280
There are 10 of us, you know!

16:48.280 --> 16:51.280
We'll fill the hole you created!

16:51.580 --> 16:52.960
So believe in us!

16:52.960 --> 16:55.540
Believe in your friends!

16:58.630 --> 17:01.800
Ms. Idiot, do you have any objections?

17:02.510 --> 17:06.760
Oh man, I just got told by TsubaHii.

17:07.050 --> 17:08.430
What did you say?!

17:14.020 --> 17:15.600
Thank you both.

17:18.940 --> 17:21.980
Okay! Only 6 minutes left to decide our fate!

17:21.980 --> 17:24.200
Use all of your talents together and win!

17:24.360 --> 17:26.910
Subaru-san, we can win, right?

17:26.910 --> 17:28.950
There's still a chance, right?

17:29.530 --> 17:30.740
Of course!

17:30.740 --> 17:32.200
I believe in all of you!

17:32.450 --> 17:33.330
Okay!

17:38.710 --> 17:41.590
Go! Go! Keishin!

17:41.590 --> 17:44.470
Go! Go! Keishin!

17:44.840 --> 17:47.430
They've finally come together.

17:47.430 --> 17:51.470
Yeah, they've become a true team now.

18:01.360 --> 18:03.440
S-So short!

18:04.820 --> 18:07.110
Maintain your cool and keep on scoring!

18:10.990 --> 18:11.700
Mimi!

18:18.080 --> 18:19.880
I did it, Master!

18:20.330 --> 18:21.920
You're running out of time!

18:21.920 --> 18:23.550
Go! Airi!

18:37.020 --> 18:38.940
I did it!

18:39.140 --> 18:42.440
Jeez! They've opened up the score again!

18:43.480 --> 18:44.690
You're in the way!

18:44.690 --> 18:46.440
No, <i>you're</i> in the way!

18:48.490 --> 18:49.490
Hey!

18:55.370 --> 18:57.000
They subbed in another shooter.

18:57.540 --> 19:01.080
Two minutes left. This is it.

19:04.590 --> 19:05.210
Masami!

19:08.720 --> 19:09.380
Got it!

19:38.410 --> 19:41.170
Don't give up!

19:43.290 --> 19:46.130
That's right! Don't give up!

19:46.130 --> 19:49.170
That's not what Subaru taught us!

19:51.010 --> 19:52.050
<i>That's right.</i>

19:52.050 --> 19:55.010
<i>Subaru-san taught us so many things.</i>

19:55.220 --> 19:59.520
<i>He taught us how difficult, how strict, and ultimately, how fun basketball can be.</i>

19:59.850 --> 20:02.600
<i>But Onii-chan...</i>

20:02.980 --> 20:06.110
<i>...He </i>never<i> told us that it was okay to give up!</i>

20:11.950 --> 20:15.120
<i>We'll </i>definitely<i> win!</i>

21:24.560 --> 21:26.810
39-39!

21:26.810 --> 21:28.810
With this, we're going into overtime!

21:39.120 --> 21:42.370
<i>Wow! They're all so amazing!</i>

21:42.370 --> 21:45.330
<i>They've matured so much! Not only in their abilities!</i>

21:48.960 --> 21:53.670
<i>Elementary schoolers are definitely... the best!</i>

21:56.560 --> 21:59.310
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

21:59.310 --> 22:00.850
Rolling! Rolling!

22:00.850 --> 22:03.770
Keep on bouncing!

22:02.060 --> 22:04.780
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

22:04.780 --> 22:07.190
Elementary schoolers are the best!

22:07.190 --> 22:07.570
Yay!

22:11.660 --> 22:16.660
Our bodies and our hearts are size SS,

22:17.160 --> 22:22.580
but our dreams can be size LL, can't they? Can't they?

22:22.580 --> 22:27.970
Adolescents have lots of troubles,

22:27.970 --> 22:33.550
but we'll overcome them together.

22:33.550 --> 22:38.980
I want to get even better!

22:34.350 --> 22:35.720
Even

22:35.720 --> 22:37.060
better!

22:38.980 --> 22:46.650
I want to see your face when I surprise you!

22:39.980 --> 22:40.480
Ooh!

22:41.270 --> 22:41.710
Wow!

22:46.860 --> 22:49.570
Just keep on spinning!

22:49.570 --> 22:53.490
The Earth is one big basketball!

22:53.490 --> 22:57.160
I'll believe in the future and move forward!

22:56.540 --> 22:58.080
I'll keep going!

22:57.790 --> 23:00.500
Just keep on spinning!

23:00.500 --> 23:04.460
The universe is one big basketball court!

23:04.460 --> 23:07.880
I want you to receive it.

23:07.170 --> 23:08.130
Ready, and!

23:07.880 --> 23:09.720
Pass! Pass! Pass!

23:10.130 --> 23:12.130
Please take it!

23:13.390 --> 23:16.140
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:16.140 --> 23:17.680
Rolling! Rolling!

23:17.680 --> 23:20.560
Keep on bouncing!

23:18.810 --> 23:21.560
Rolling! Rolling! Growing!

23:21.560 --> 23:24.020
Elementary schoolers are the best!

23:24.020 --> 23:25.980
Yay!

23:26.720 --> 23:29.430
Do your best in overtime, Tomoka!

23:29.430 --> 23:30.440
I'll do my best!

23:30.440 --> 23:33.900
Um, after the game, Subaru-san, can you...

23:33.900 --> 23:34.310
Huh?

23:34.310 --> 23:36.110
I-It's nothing!

23:36.110 --> 23:37.280
Let's do our best!

23:37.280 --> 23:38.860
Okay! Let's go!

23:37.990 --> 23:41.000
Because You're Here, Tomoka

23:37.990 --> 23:41.000
Next episode

23:38.860 --> 23:40.240
Yeah!
